  "text": "No lint errors. Here's a summary of what was implemented in `BookmarksPage.tsx`:\n\n**Category assignment** -- Each bookmark is automatically categorized based on its URL and nav ID:\n- **Admin** -- URLs starting with `/admin`, `/org`, `/plugins`, `/profile` or IDs matching `cfg`, `admin`, `plugin`, etc.\n- **Operations** -- URLs starting with `/alerting`, `/connections`, `/monitoring`, `/infrastructure`, `/incidents` or IDs matching `alerting`, `connections`, `monitoring`, etc.\n- **Content** -- Everything else (dashboards, explore, drilldown, playlists, etc.)\n\n**Filtering** -- A `RadioButtonGroup` at the top lets users filter by category. Each option shows a count (e.g., \"All (5)\", \"Operations (2)\"). Selecting a specific category shows only those bookmarks in a flat grid.\n\n**Grouped display** -- When \"All\" is selected, bookmarks are grouped under section headers with a `Badge` count for each category (blue for Operations, purple for Admin, green for Content). Empty groups are hidden.\n\n**Components used** -- All existing Grafana UI: `RadioButtonGroup`, `Badge`, `Stack`, `Text`, `EmptyState`, and `NavLandingPageCard`.",
