  "text": "\nCreated the project skill at `.cursor/skills/grafana-feature-flag-navigate-migration/SKILL.md`.\n\n**Skill summary**\n\n| Aspect | Details |\n|--------|---------|\n| **Name** | `grafana-feature-flag-navigate-migration` |\n| **Scope** | Project (`.cursor/skills/`) |\n| **Triggers** | Migrating Grafana navigation, feature-flagged `useNavigate`, React Router migration with rollback safety |\n\n**Workflow**\n\n1. Add feature flag in `registry.go` (naming: `{feature}UseNavigate`)\n2. Run `make gen-feature-toggles` (unless explicitly skipped)\n3. Update components with flag-gated `navigate` vs `locationService`\n4. Update tests: mock `useNavigate`, reset flag and location in `beforeEach`, restore `config.featureToggles` in `afterEach`, assert both flag states\n5. Run tests and lints\n\n**Patterns captured**\n\n- `originalFeatureToggles` save/restore to avoid test pollution\n- `locationService.push('/')` in `beforeEach` for a stable baseline\n- Partial mock of `react-router-dom-v5-compat` to keep `useParams` and other exports\n- Separate test blocks for flag on vs off\n\nThe skill points to the existing `react-router-migration` skill for code patterns and common pitfalls.",
