  "text": "\nHere are the main files involved in the bookmarks page UI:\n\n---\n\n## Core page component\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/features/bookmarks/BookmarksPage.tsx`** | Main bookmarks page: layout, empty state, grid of bookmark cards, and grid styles (`getStyles`) |\n\n---\n\n## Shared UI components\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/core/components/NavLandingPage/NavLandingPageCard.tsx`** | Card used for each bookmark: heading, description, link, category styles, and card layout |\n| **`public/app/core/components/Page/Page.tsx`** | Page wrapper (header, scroll, layout) |\n| **`packages/grafana-ui/src/components/EmptyState/EmptyState.tsx`** | Empty state when there are no bookmarks |\n\n---\n\n## Data and behavior\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/hooks.ts`** | `usePinnedItems()` – returns pinned/bookmarked nav URLs from user preferences |\n| **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/utils.ts`** | `findByUrl()` – finds nav items by URL in the nav tree |\n| **`public/app/core/reducers/navBarTree.ts`** | Nav tree state and bookmark handling |\n\n---\n\n## Routing and nav\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/routes/routes.tsx`** | Route for `/bookmarks` |\n| **`public/app/core/utils/navBarItem-translations.ts`** | Labels for \"Bookmarks\" and \"Bookmark pages for them to appear here\" |\n| **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/MegaMenu.tsx`** | Mega menu integration and bookmark section |\n| **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/MegaMenuItemText.tsx`** | Add/remove bookmark UI in nav items |\n\n---\n\n## Reference for layout\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/core/components/NavLandingPage/NavLandingPage.tsx`** | Similar landing page layout; `BookmarksPage` uses the same grid pattern and `NavLandingPageCard` |\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n- **Layout and styling:** `BookmarksPage.ts