ewPage.tsx` -- start here, validate the full workflow\n2. `PlaylistEditPage.tsx` -- near-identical, share the same feature flag (`playlistUseNavigate`)\n3. `StartModal.tsx` -- same flag, slightly more complex URL construction\n4. `PlaylistSrv.ts` -- defer; needs architectural discussion about non-component navigation",
